# One line-ending for every text file on every machine: LF, the same as CI
# (Linux) and Vercel. Without this, Git for Windows (core.autocrlf=true)
# checked files out as CRLF, and the unit tests that read source files and
# match across lines failed on Windows only.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
*.xlsx binary
*.pdf binary
